## 2.2 Architecturally Significant Requirements (ASR)

ASR diturunkan dari NFR pada **BRD BAB 12** dengan menyeleksi kebutuhan yang: (a) berprioritas *Critical/High*, (b) sulit diubah setelah arsitektur ditetapkan, atau (c) memengaruhi banyak komponen. Setiap ASR diberi identifier **ARC-xxx**.

| ARC ID  | Architectural Driver (ASR)                          | Sumber NFR         | Implikasi Arsitektur Utama                                                        |
| ------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| ARC-001 | Integritas & konsistensi data lintas modul           | NFR-007, NFR-008   | PostgreSQL ACID per layanan + Saga/Outbox + Selective Exactly-Once (ADR-005).     |
| ARC-002 | Skalabilitas horizontal tanpa perubahan source code  | NFR-010, NFR-011   | Layanan Go *stateless* + Kubernetes HPA + partisi Kafka + partisi PostgreSQL.     |
| ARC-003 | Ketersediaan tinggi (SLA ≥ 99,5%) & redundansi        | NFR-004, NFR-005   | Multi-replica K8s, PostgreSQL HA, Kafka RF≥3, tanpa *single point of failure*.    |
| ARC-004 | Isolasi beban & data multi-tenant                    | NFR-012            | Hybrid Multi-Tenancy (ADR-002) + RLS + resource quota + Kafka client quota.       |
| ARC-005 | *Independent deployment* per modul                   | NFR-013            | Microservices + database-per-service (ADR-001) + CI/CD per layanan.               |
| ARC-006 | Ketahanan terhadap kegagalan sementara               | NFR-009            | Event-driven (Kafka) + retry/DLQ + circuit breaker + idempotensi.                 |
| ARC-007 | Kinerja responsif (P95 < 2 dtk; dashboard < 3 dtk)   | NFR-001, NFR-003   | Go latensi rendah, caching, read replica, CQRS read model, React 19 SPA.          |
| ARC-008 | Keamanan sistemik & kepatuhan                        | NFR-016–021        | OAuth2/OIDC di Kong, enkripsi in-transit/at-rest, audit stream, RLS.              |
| ARC-009 | *API & schema versioning* tanpa *breaking change*    | NFR-014            | Versioning di Kong + Apicurio (kompatibilitas backward/forward).                  |
| ARC-010 | Evolvability & maintainability jangka panjang        | NFR-013, NFR-015   | Clean/Hexagonal architecture, kontrak eksplisit, dokumentasi terkelola.           |
| ARC-011 | Pemulihan bencana (RTO ≤ 4 jam, RPO ≤ 15 mnt)        | NFR-028–030        | PITR/WAL archiving geo-redundant, Kafka MirrorMaker, failover terorkestrasi.      |
| ARC-012 | Lokalisasi & aksesibilitas                           | NFR-022–027        | React i18n, tabel locale PostgreSQL, komponen WCAG 2.1 AA.                         |

